 {tab==='Pilot & targets'&&<><Card title="Operating target register" caption="No bank SLA is assumed. Proposed, agreed and measured values remain distinct."><div className="form-grid"><label>Measure<select value={target} onChange={e=>setTarget(e.target.value)}>{targetNames.map(x=><option key={x}>{x}</option>)}</select></label><label>Bank owner<input value={owner} onChange={e=>setOwner(e.target.value)}/></label><label>Proposed target<input value={proposed} onChange={e=>setProposed(e.target.value)}/></label><label>Agreed target / approval reference<input value={agreed} onChange={e=>setAgreed(e.target.value)}/></label></div><Btn onClick={()=>run({type:'target',key:target,proposed,agreed,owner})}>Save target entry</Btn><Table headers={['Measure','Owner','Proposed','Agreed','Measured / status']}>{targetNames.map(k=><tr key={k}><td>{k}</td><td>{s.targets[k]?.owner||'To be assigned'}</td><td>{s.targets[k]?.proposed||'Not specified'}</td><td>{s.targets[k]?.agreed||'Pending bank agreement'}</td><td>Not measured<small>{s.targets[k]?.status||'Bank input required'}</small></td></tr>)}</Table></Card><div className="two-col"><Card title="Read-only shadow pilot"><p>Compare against the existing manual process at a fixed review capacity. Include ordinary payments, adjudicated historical cases and an officer-reviewed sample of unflagged transactions.</p><ol><li>Agree scope, labels, masking and success criteria.</li><li>Run screening without customer or account actions.</li><li>Measure relevance, missed issues, handling time and cost.</li><li>Compare rules alone, graph context and incremental AI support.</li><li>Record uncertainty, exclusions and bank go/no-go.</li></ol><Notice>Acceptance fixtures establish software behaviour. They do not establish bank fraud accuracy, prevented losses or recovered funds.</Notice></Card><Card title="Record pilot measurements" caption="Administrator entry. Values are not independently verified bank results."><div className="form-grid">{Object.keys(pilot).map(k=><label key={k}>{k.replace(/([A-Z])/g,' $1')}<input min="0" type="number" value={pilot[k]} onChange={e=>setPilot({...pilot,[k]:Number(e.target.value)})}/></label>)}</div><label>Cohort / exclusions / label definition<textarea value={note} onChange={e=>setNote(e.target.value)}/></label><Btn onClick={()=>run({type:'pilot',values:pilot,note})}>Record observation</Btn>{s.pilot.map((x,i)=><div className="history-row" key={i}><b>{x.label}</b><p>{x.relevant}/{x.reviewed} relevant reviewed cases; {x.falseAlerts}/{x.reviewed} false alerts. {x.foundKnown}/{x.knownProblems} known problems found; {x.missedInSample}/{x.unflaggedSample} issues in unflagged sample.</p><p>Handling time: {x.manualMinutes} → {x.assistedMinutes} minutes.</p><small>Selection bias applies; no population-wide recall claim.</small></div>)}</Card></div></>}
 {tab==='Technology'&&<><Architecture/><div className="service-grid">{services.map(x=><Card key={x.name} title={x.name} action={<Tag>Not connected</Tag>}><p>{x.purpose}</p><KV rows={[["Delivered",x.status],["Required",x.dependency]]}/></Card>)}</div><Card title="How each capability helps"><Table headers={['Bank question','Feature','Proof available here']}>{[['Where did the money go?','Graph traversal','Chronological payment paths with edge source links'],['Is this payment unusual?','Rules first; optional One-Class SVM','Independent amount/speed/novelty signals; no invented model score'],['What supports the concern?','Filtered evidence retrieval','Exact case passages and citations; vector contract for deployment'],['What should I check next?','Bounded agent tools','Case-aware answers and allowed-tool activity'],['Who can approve the finding?','APEX review integration','Backend maker/checker workflow plus APEX/ORDS contract']].map(row=><tr key={row[0]}>{row.map((c,i)=><td key={i}>{c}</td>)}</tr>)}</Table></Card></>}
 {tab==='About'&&<Card title="Environment, provenance & limitations"><KV rows={[["Release",'4.0.0'],["Environment",'Evaluation application'],["Records",provenance.records],["Execution",provenance.execution],["Workspace",mode],["Bank / Oracle connections",'Not configured'],["Model accuracy",'Not measured on bank data'],["Authentication",'Selectable local personas; bank SSO/MFA required'],["Audit retention",'Local persistence; production immutable retention not implemented'],["Scope",'Sole-banking, non-consortium end-use monitoring']]}/><p>The UCO name and emblem are used for this requested presentation. This application does not imply bank endorsement. Public research requires approved provider access. No account restrictions, external communications, recovery action or formal fraud classification are executed.</p><p>Current source references and integration requirements are included in the source package. Use generated or authorised masked records only in this local environment.</p></Card>}
